    "body": "## 🎟️ Tracking\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira or GitHub issue or otherwise describe / point to where this change is coming from. -->\r\n[CL-700](https://bitwarden.atlassian.net/browse/CL-700)\r\n\r\n## 📔 Objective\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe what the purpose of this PR is, for example what bug you're fixing or new feature you're adding. -->\r\nThe anon-layout components are being pulled into the component library, since they are being used in many places now and will need some changes to support new usages that are unrelated to the auth team.\r\n\r\nThis PR does the following:\r\n- Move the component files into UIF-owned areas\r\n- Move icons referred to by the components into the CL\r\n- Update imports for consumers\r\n- Minor Storybook updates to fix some issues that popped up as a result of the move\r\n\r\n## ⏰ Reminders before review\r\n\r\n- Contributor guidelines followed\r\n- All formatters and local linters executed and passed\r\n- Written new unit and / or integration tests where applicable\r\n- Protected functional changes with optionality (feature flags)\r\n- Used internationalization (i18n) for all UI strings\r\n- CI builds passed\r\n- Communicated to DevOps any deployment requirements\r\n- Updated any necessary documentation (Confluence, contributing docs) or informed the documentation team\r\n\r\n## 🦮 Reviewer guidelines\r\n\r\n<!-- Suggested interactions but feel free to use (or not) as you desire! -->\r\n\r\n- 👍 (`:+1:`) or similar for great changes\r\n- 📝 (`:memo:`) or ℹ️ (`:information_source:`) for notes or general info\r\n- ❓ (`:question:`) for questions\r\n- 🤔 (`:thinking:`) or 💭 (`:thought_balloon:`) for more open inquiry that's not quite a confirmed issue and could potentially benefit from discussion\r\n- 🎨 (`:art:`) for suggestions / improvements\r\n- ❌ (`:x:`) or ⚠️ (`:warning:`) for more significant problems or concerns needing attention\r\n- 🌱 (`:seedling:`) or ♻️ (`:recycle:`) for future improvements or indications of technical debt\r\n- ⛏ (`:pick:`) for minor or nitpick changes\r\n\r\n\r\n[CL-700]: https://bitwarden.atlassian.net/browse/CL-700?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ",
